{
  "schema": "numinia-engine/franjas@1",
  "_doc": "Time-of-day bands. `desde` = the world hour (0-24, multiples of 0.05) at which each band starts; a band lasts until the next one starts, around the clock. `textos`: one block per language, same keys; `idioma` picks the block a server says aloud (default en). Neutral wording on purpose: lore is the world's to add.",
